.pytest_cache/

# Test outputs — results are tracked for traceability
test_output.log
tests/results/test_history.log

# Raw network-probe evidence logs. These contain live device fingerprints
# (gateway serials, interface MACs, LAN addresses) captured from hardware.
# tests/results/ IS tracked, and AP-3 forbids real hardware identifiers in
# tracked directories — so commit the sanitised summary, never the raw log.
# The probe scrubs serials/MACs/passwords itself; this is defence in depth.
tests/results/*.jsonl

# AGENT.md is tracked (agent onboarding doc)

